cology in ocular tumor management”"},{"record_id":"rec_000120","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"VITA is a new cross-modal model linking H&E slides and RNA signatures for virtual transcriptomic approximation. The abstract does not indicate any text/language component.","evidence_snippet":"“we propose VITA (VIrtual Transcriptomic Approximation)” and “aligning H&E and RNA into a joint latent space”"}]}
